  "prefLabel": "Crv 104.02 Communication with the Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Crv 104.02 Communication with the Commission.\n\n(a) Persons wishing to make submissions to, or requests of, the commission may mail a letter to the address stated in Crv 104.01(a), call the number stated in Crv 104.01(b) or communicate by TTY/TDD using the number stated in Crv 104.01(c).\n\n(b) Persons seeking information from the commission may do so by mail, telephone or TTY as described in paragraph (a).\n\nSource. #7567, eff 9-28-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/crv100.html"
